This is a simple application that helps to better organize your QRZ log when adding POTA activations. Simply 
add your park ie' US-1409m select the log file from your POTA logging app and click the button.
The new file will save in the same folder as your log. Now upload the new file to QRZ and in the comments the park you
activated will show in the comments.

This application is free to anyone who wants to use it. I give no guarantees on this app but I have used it a lot and it works every time.

